===Etymology 2===
From {{bor|en|la|sorōricīda||one who kills his sister}}, from {{m|la|soror||sister}} + {{m|la|-cīda||killer}}. Equivalent to {{suffix|en|la:soror|t1=sister|cide|id2=killer|t2=killer}}.

====Noun====
{{en-noun}}

# A [[person]] who [[kill]]s his or her sister.

=====Coordinate terms=====
* {{sense|brother killer}} {{l|en|fratricide}}

=====Translations=====
